  "body": "# Amber-Infused: Tool Trims\n\nA resourcepack from my Amber-Infused series.\n\nIt adds tool trims when adding \"Amber-Infused\" in the start of the tool name(ex. Amber-Infused Stone Pickaxe).\nSupports every material.\n\n## Added:\n* Sword\n* Pickaxe\n* Axe\n* Shovel\n* Hoe\n* Bow\n* Crossbow\n* Spear\n* Mace\n\n## Planned:\n* Trident\n* Shield\n* Modded tools support(additional resource pack)\n* Support for older version(<1.21.5) via mods",
